    m_Localized: '[ Controls ]


      Move: WASD


      Sprint: Hold [Shift] to
      run faster


      Pick Up Items: Press [F]


      Release: Press [Q]


      Egg
      Mode: Press [E]


      Quack!!: Press [R]


      Action: [Spacebar]


      Menu:
      [ESC] Open Settings


      [ Survival Tips ]


      Warning: Don''t let Maple
      overheat!


      Refresh: Dive into the pond to cool down.


      [ Weather
      System ]


      Sunny: Heat rises faster.


      Cloudy: Heat rises slower.


      [
      Quick Start ]


      Just Try it! QuAck!!'
